[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0010","text":"日花，你看到观众席了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0020","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0030","text":"大家是来看日花的哦\n……大家都在等着偶像呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0050","text":"不需要迷茫"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0060","text":"今天的舞台也好，服装也好\n都是属于日花的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0070","text":"不会出错，也不用在意任何人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0080","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0090","text":"好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0100","text":"……我连在意的余裕都没有\n我出发了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
